=========================
>>> testCase "CALL function with wrong number of arguments during work-phase"
>>> setupFile ~/targetPackage/main.petrol
PREP_FUNC @myFunc {
    PRINT("This line is not reached")
}
PREP_FUNC @printError {
    [ARGS [@args]]
    TRY {
        CALL(CALL, args)
    } CATCH {
        [EXCEP @excep]
        PRINT(MEMBER(excep, #MESSAGE))
    }
}
printError(LIST ())
printError(LIST (myFunc, LIST (), 3))
>>> expectPrint
Too few arguments passed to function.
Too many arguments passed to function.
